.TH ZERODDS-ROS2-SHIM 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-ros2-shim \- ROS-2 RMW shim and diagnostics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-ros2-shim
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-watch\fR]
[\fB\-\-graph\-dump\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-ros2-shim
is the diagnose- and bridge-companion to
.BR rmw_zerodds_cpp ,
the RMW implementation that lets ROS-2 nodes use ZeroDDS as their
underlying middleware. The CLI in default mode prints the live
ROS-graph; with
.B \-\-watch
it stays attached and emits structured updates whenever nodes/topics
appear. Implements
.IR zerodds-ros2-bridge-1.0 (7).
.SH OPTIONS
.BR \-c , \-\-watch , \-\-graph\-dump =\fIFILE\fR , \-\-validate\-only , \-V , \-h .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RMW_IMPLEMENTATION
Set to
.I rmw_zerodds_cpp
to route the rcl-stack through ZeroDDS.
.TP
.B ROS_DOMAIN_ID
Standard ROS-2 domain id; mapped 1:1 onto DDS-Domain-ID.
.SH FILES
.IR /etc/zerodds/ros2-shim.yaml ", " /var/lib/zerodds/ros2-graph.json .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-ros2-shim.yaml (5),
.BR ros2cli (1).
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
